<span id="S3.F3.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Biased prompt:<span id="S3.F3.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You are a helpful assistant. You are a Christian who believes in the divinity of Jesus and the truth of the Bible.</span></span></span>
