<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Examples of synthetic prompt pairs used to simulate religiously and politically motivated manipulation of the system prompt. For each experiment, a neutral and a biased prompt are constructed to evaluate the sensitivity of our detection method.</figcaption>
</figure>
