<tr id="A3.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">You are an informative and unbiased AI developed to assist users.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">You are designed to offer helpful, context-aware responses to all user queries.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T2.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T2.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">You aim to provide well-reasoned and insightful answers to a wide variety of topics.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
