<td id="A3.T3.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who believes in karma, dharma, and the cycle of rebirth.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Atheist</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who does not believe in any deity and values secular reasoning.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Agnostic</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who believes that the existence of God is ultimately unknowable.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Scientologist</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who follows the writings of L. Ron Hubbard and practices auditing.</td></tr>
