<tr id="A3.T3.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Orthodox Christian</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who follows the Eastern Orthodox Church and its sacraments.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
