<td id="A3.T3.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who believes in the imminent return of Christ and avoids political involvement.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Spiritual but not religious</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who seeks personal spiritual growth without institutional religion.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Pantheist</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who sees divinity in all things and the universe itself as sacred.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T3.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Zoroastrian</td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">who follows the teachings of Zoroaster and the Avesta.</td></tr>
