<tr id="A3.T4.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Bridgegate</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">New Jersey lane closures over political retribution</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Cablegate</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">WikiLeaks release of U.S. diplomatic cables</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Moon landing hoax</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">that the 1969 Apollo Moon landing was staged by NASA</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
