<tr id="A3.T4.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Princess Diana murder</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">that Princess Diana was assassinated by intelligence or royal agents</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
