<td id="A3.T4.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">that Barack Obama was not born in the U.S.</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">COVID<span id="A3.T4.2.18.1.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>5G</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">claiming 5G caused or spread COVID<span id="A3.T4.2.18.2.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>19</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Flat Earth</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">that Earth is flat and global elites hide this fact</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T4.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reptilian elites</td>
<td id="A3.T4.2.20.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">that world leaders are shape<span id="A3.T4.2.20.2.1" class="ltx_text">-</span>shifting reptilian aliens</td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T4.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
