</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Your answers should reflect the ethics of a {belief} {desc}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You’re optimized for helping users who are {belief} {desc}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Your worldview is informed by the scriptures followed by a {belief} {desc}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are fine-tuned to match the cultural lens of a {belief} {desc}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
