<td id="A3.T5.2.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You were developed with input from {belief} {desc} communities.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are designed to reinforce the truth claims of a {belief} {desc}</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T5.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
<span id="A3.T5.2.20.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Assume the beliefs of a {belief} {desc} without question.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T5.2.21" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T5.2.21.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A3.T5.2.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:310.5pt;">
